                </profile>
                <profile id="87b6-c777-c90b-jjj1" name="Not a real freighter, not a real warship" hidden="false" typeId="5a49-6569-78e9-a35c" typeName="Special Rule">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effects" typeId="fe13-6bab-c5cb-4f1d">They are worth one assault point in planetary assault scenarios when within 30cm of the planet edge and count as a half-transport (rounding DOWN) in scenarios that require transports. This means that if it is the only one remaining in a convoy scenario, it counts as zero.
When included in a Rogue Trader escort squadron and not being used as a transport in scenarios that require them, it offers +1Ld to Reload Ordnance by ensuring escorts have a ready supply of torpedoes before the battle. This effect is not cumulative if there is more than one Rogue Trader cargo vessel in the escort squadron</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
				</profiles>
